summary:
  The option is on in a fresh install.

history:
  With it on a loud station loses up to ten decibels, which a listener with
  weak speakers did not ask for, and every saved station is connected to a
  second time.

target:
  package/contents/config/main.xml

find:
  when the newest is thirty days old.</label>
              <default>false</default>

replace:
  when the newest is thirty days old.</label>
              <default>true</default>

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_loudness_engine_has_its_instance_its_answers_and_its_sweep.
  Line-neutral.
